WEBVTT

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.880
This is White Rock.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.170
Enemy on target.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:55.470
Yes, Sir.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.130
All spaceships stand by.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.270
All spaceships aim.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:06.770
Fire.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:19.570
Oh, no!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:21.240
All ships retreat!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:50.980
Episode #4
MIHOSHI FALLS TO THE LAND OF STARS

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.080
Seventh Headquarters,
the Commander speaking.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.170
Hey, long time no see.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.750
It's you, Marshal?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:14.960
Yes.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.590
We've found
our wanted, Kagato.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.170
Kagato?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.300
He was spotted
at the ancient ruins...

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.930
of planet number 617, area 3...

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.180
of the constellation Swan.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:28.100
The troopers on the beat
contacted the patrol fleet.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.060
They gave chase,
but they were destroyed.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.350
We figured out
the enemies' escape route.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.440
They escaped into
this solar system.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.650
Initiate a search immediately.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.360
Yes, sir!

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.410
Tea for you, Commander.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.950
Ah... thank you.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.120
Isn't it terrible
what happened?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.080
Yes.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.370
Who is patrolling...

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.250
The Special Protection Zone
of the solar system?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.420
Detective First-class Mihoshi.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.960
Are you O.K.?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.510
Mihoshi? Oh, no!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.760
We have
no more budget for her.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.930
But she is
an outstanding detective.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.180
If the budget
is not a problem...

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.140
Maybe.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.270
For example...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.390
Do you know
what that is?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:18.690
Misconduct reports...
and, oh, so many bills.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:19.690
Right.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.570
These are mostly
because of one officer.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.660
Detective Mihoshi?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.160
Exactly.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.240
Oh, I think I have
an idea how to solve this.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.080
What?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.880
Maybe I can help
get rid of Mihoshi.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.380
Let me handle it.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.490
Emergency call!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.820
Ouch!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.620
What happened?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.660
I have to hurry
to the cockpit.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.960
Ouch!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.580
What a mess!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.470
You're late!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.340
What have you been doing?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.390
I'm sorry.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.020
Can I be of service?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.270
Can you be of service?

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.230
What the hell are you wearing?

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.740
We have a serious problem.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.990
The wanted criminal Kagato...

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.320
is headed for
the solar system...

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.240
that you are in charge of.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.450
Look here...

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.040
If you trace him...

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.920
contact the Special Prosecutor...

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.380
and we'll take care of it.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:02.550
Yes, sir.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.840
I will prove myself
by capturing Kagato.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.430
No!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.260
You are the Marshal's
granddaughter.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.180
If something happens,
I'll be blamed.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.020
I'm a Galaxy Police officer,
and danger is my business.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.140
Don't worry
about my Grandfather.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.020
No!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.100
Listen to me!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.690
I'm on my way.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.730
I'm turning off communications,
but don't worry...

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.530
You can count on me.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.070
Wait, Mihoshi!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.530
Kagato, huh?

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.780
Yukinojo!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.790
Did you call me, Miss Mihoshi?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.710
I need a profile of Kagato.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.800
Coming right up.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.710
Space Pirate Kagato...

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.090
A.K.A. Ruins Buster...

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.680
Estimated age--
5,000 years...

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.220
He controls a huge
spaceship called Soja...

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.010
and has been ravaging cultural
assets all over the galaxy.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.100
A nefarious fellow!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.980
The number of ruins
he destroyed is 3,326.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.150
The number of cultural
artifacts stolen is uncountable.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.150
Oo.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.440
It's no time
to be impressed.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.150
Are you ready
for the nitty-gritty?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.650
Yes.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.950
In the year of
the space calendar, 5901...

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:16.040
he burglarized the antiquities
museum on planet Alpha.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:20.750
The same year 2,000 people,
including government officials,...

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.040
evaporated on Beta.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.340
In 5903, entire cities on the
planet Yura were destroyed.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.420
In 5904 severe interference
with electromagnetic fields...

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.300
on planet Skylark.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.310
In 5912, a girl was abducted
from the Royal Space Academy...

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.350
on planet Todain.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.230
Oh, this last one may
not belong here.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.150
Then came the mass plundering...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.570
I want a cup of coffee!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.030
Miss Mihoshi,
are you listening carefully?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.650
I've had enough.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.110
I just have to catch him.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.040
Guess I'll cruise
around here a little.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:17.720
Here we are.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.850
Come, sister.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:24.020
Don't talk so loud.
That's impolite.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.900
Welcome.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.530
We're off to a busy year,
Nobuyuki.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:33.200
Are all these
Tenchi's girlfriends?

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.450
Well... I believe so.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:41.910
All these girls
with their heavy luggage.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.960
Shall I help you?

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.210
Wow. It's heavy.
Get off.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.750
Tenchi, I must
talk to you.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.380
What about?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.720
Just remember
we're not in my house.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.760
Just act normally.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.600
The lady here
is very nice to me.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.390
Really?

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.140
Anyway...

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.930
Do be quiet!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.560
Why do you speak to me
like that?

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.060
You like her, don't you?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.860
What do you mean?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.190
You were making out
in the mountain cabin.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.900
You've been acting
weird since then.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.700
No, there's nothing.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:17.990
There you go.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.530
You look like you're thinking
strange thoughts.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.290
That girl is scary!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.830
Have you forgotten
I risked my life for you?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.340
Come down!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.800
Somebody may be
watching us.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.970
Tenchi, let's do something wild.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.640
Don't talk stupid.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:38.720
Oh, really?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.470
So it's fine with Ayeka
but not with me?

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.900
What's her problem?

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.110
Peeping!?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.490
Keep your voice down.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.990
Are you trying to teach me
to be a peeping Tom?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.410
Tenchi, when you
come to a place like this,...

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.250
you know
there are young women...

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.880
taking a bath up there.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.840
It would be rude
not to peep.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.670
But if the old lady finds out,
she'll kill us.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.720
Like someone who peeps
is afraid of an old woman?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.680
What's that for?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:22.640
Stupid.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:25.640
This is how the authentic
peeping tom looks.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.350
For heaven's sake,
stop that.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:32.400
Hurry. Everybody's
waiting for us.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.950
Yo. What are you doing here?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.540
This is where you have been.
I was wondering where you were.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.010
Come up here.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:00.680
What do you mean come up?
That's the women's area.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.220
Did you say something?

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.970
There's more space
up there.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:08.930
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.270
Oh, stop that, will you?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.440
Hold me tight or you'll fall.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.200
What are you
embarrassed about?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.750
You've seen me
naked before.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.420
Yeah, but you were just
a mummy.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.550
Tenchi.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.260
You're late.
Are you alone?

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.140
No, my sister
is with me.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.800
Ayeka!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.430
Don't be so loud!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:52.060
You're always rude
since you met that woman.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.310
Do you hear me, Sasami?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.150
Ayeka...

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.280
What happened?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.450
Tenchi is here too,
you know.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.950
Why didn't you
tell me that before?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.450
I'll join you later.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.290
Why? We've come a long way.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.410
-Let's go in together.
-Get away from me.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.080
-Oh, come on.
-Stop that.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.800
You're a poor sport.
Just come off it.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.210
Tenchi is
waiting for you outside.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:24.010
Stop!
Please stop!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.430
Why should you
be embarrassed now?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.180
You were quite aggressive
at the cabin.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.020
How do you know that?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:37.310
It's simple. I'm borrowing
Ryo-Ohki's memory.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.160
You've come this far,
make up your mind.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.100
Tenchi.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.140
Oh. Excuse me.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.730
Tenchi.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.780
Are you O.K.?

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:27.450
Yes, I'm O.K.
Thank you, Sasami.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.740
You don't look good...

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.540
and your nose is bleeding.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.870
Aren't you the little pervert!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.000
Don't get me wrong.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.540
I'm a little woozy
after that hot bath.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.250
Really?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.300
Excuse me.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.510
Attaboy!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.470
What are you doing to me?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.600
They're watching us.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.390
Who cares if either of us
is nude?

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.610
That's what I mean.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.810
You're insensitive.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.480
I wouldn't mind other guys,
but not him.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.950
You were going to show yourself
to Tenchi sooner or later.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.790
I'm not a showoff
like you.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.410
You bathe naked,
don't you?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.580
You're not proud
of yourself, are you?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.130
I guess I understand.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.710
If what I said was offensive,
show yourself to me.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.260
Um...

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.890
Never mind.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.020
I can't stand this anymore.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.820
You're wrong if you think
I am harmless.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.660
What can a lady
like you do?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.410
This is what I used
last time to stop your ship.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:02.080
This time you won't have
Tenchi's help.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.550
That's all a lady can do,
I suppose.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:11.550
Let's see how long you
can keep talking like that.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:15.970
She's above--

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.560
You!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.570
This time it's my turn
to show you something.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.320
You know why I'm called Ryoko?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.910
It's because I can raise spirits
from anything under the sun.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.420
That sounds interesting.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.380
You can use these things
in this way, too.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:11.740
Let that tomboy
play with you.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.200
What are you doing?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.910
Go on!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.620
Oh, my.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.210
Are you turning on me?

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.210
Go back to Earth,
you ungrateful one.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.220
Oh, I made a mistake.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:44.060
I need a gem on my right wrist
to control the monster.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.780
What an entertaining spectacle.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.410
Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.710
What are you doing?
Fetch the sword right away.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.300
Miss Mihoshi!
Miss Mihoshi! Miss Mihoshi!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.180
Yes?

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:18.800
An energy pocket is
developing on the third planet.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.510
The location
of the ship is...

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.680
-Miss Mihoshi?
-What shall we do?

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.310
It appears it's broken.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.190
There is no response.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.440
Miss Mihoshi!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.150
Yes?

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:32.110
O.K., turn us around.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.900
Maybe we can hit upon
some clue.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:39.280
Is it all right to speed like this
in this planetary system?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.540
Miss Mihoshi, our ship
is falling headlong...

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.790
into the energy pocket
and out of control.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.330
Oh my, that's not good.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.210
Do something about this.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:58.470
I told you without the gem on the
right wrist I have no control.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.850
Then why did you do that?

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.890
I forgot.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:04.980
You go that way.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.390
All right.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.480
Hey, you just sent me
down a dead end.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.610
Sorry about that.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.700
What's that noise?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:17.900
Get out of our way.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.320
Lady, it's dangerous
to stand there.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.280
You're so rude.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.910
Has Tenchi really fallen
for a woman like that?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.340
Tenchi!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.670
Where is the monster?

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.720
Where are Ayeka and Ryoko?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.850
Tenchi!

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:48.100
Tenchi, I'll let you
handle this one, O.K.?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.150
It's come to this.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.990
Of all the times for
this thing not to work?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.210
What am I supposed to do?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.670
Tenchi, remember your training!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.420
Yeah, that's it.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:18.970
Did it!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.190
What is that?

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.400
A spaceship?

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.910
Watch out, Tenchi!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.260
Tenchi!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.800
Help!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:24.280
Tenchi!

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.240
Are you all right?

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.250
Oh, no, Tenchi!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:43.800
Tenchi!

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.440
Good... it looks like
she's coming to.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:20:59.860
Where am I?

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.940
Where did you come from?

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:09.280
You want to know
where I came from?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:13.830
What do I do?
I have made contact with the locals.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:17.790
Excuse me. I haven't caught
your name.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.970
Sorry. My name is Mihoshi.
Um...

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:28.260
Oh, where did it go?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.260
Does anybody know
anything about it?

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.560
Are you looking for this?

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.600
Oh, yes.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:42.820
I don't know who you are
but thanks all the same.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:47.070
What are you doing?
Please give it back to me.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:52.290
What is the Galaxy Police
doing here?

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:55.000
She's Galaxy Police?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:02.380
So, you knew that?
I was chasing a felon...

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:06.970
but I was drawn into the
energy field of the monster.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.050
Oh, thank you.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.810
What is it?

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:16.770
This was broken, you know.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.230
Oh, I fixed it for you.

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:22.320
Oh, thank you.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:26.030
Wow, you must really
understand it's structure?

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:27.900
That would mean...

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:30.240
That means...?

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:37.500
You were actually able
to fix this?

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:45.420
Then you must be...

00:22:47.340 --> 00:22:48.550
Must be?

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:50.090
I must be...

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:54.890
A watch repairman?

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:02.440
I'm not!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:04.150
No?

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:06.860
What are you doing to me?

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:12.120
Ryoko is actually
a space pirate.

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:18.290
A space pirate... Ryoko?

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:24.000
What's this?

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:28.970
Space pirate Ryo-Ohki
seems to be nearby.

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:34.220
Be careful, folks. We have
a felon hiding somewhere nearby.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:37.680
Who is this Ryo-Ohki, anyway?

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:45.150
Well, let's see. He is a dreaded pirate
who destroyed 28 planets...

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:48.360
and 69 colonies.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:54.450
He's close.

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:58.660
The coordinate is 27.5
by minus 7.8

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:04.080
Oh, he is approaching us.
I'm not ready yet.

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:09.210
The distance is only... 15.

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:10.420
Centimeters!?

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:15.140
This one?

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:18.100
Yes, Ryo-Ohki.
Isn't he cute?

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:20.230
Ryo-Ohki?

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:24.480
Please don't eat it.

00:24:29.320 --> 00:24:30.490
Ouch!

00:24:32.280 --> 00:24:34.410
She's passed out again.

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:37.780
What happened?

00:24:40.410 --> 00:24:41.370
Who's this girl?

00:24:41.370 --> 00:24:42.500
Hey!

00:24:42.500 --> 00:24:45.670
Tenchi, what am I
to make of all this?

00:24:45.670 --> 00:24:47.040
Father!

00:24:48.210 --> 00:24:50.630
Somebody will have
to explain this to me.

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:42.140
Where are you?
Tsunami?

00:25:48.270 --> 00:25:50.060
Tsunami! Please help me!

00:26:04.200 --> 00:26:05.160
Who's there?

00:26:06.370 --> 00:26:10.000
Oh, it's you, Ryo-Ohki.
What's going on?

00:26:47.120 --> 00:26:49.370
So I've got the Jurai royal
family, the crown prince...

00:26:49.370 --> 00:26:51.790
Yosho, and the Princesses
before me here.

00:26:51.790 --> 00:26:56.710
Ryoko... looks like you've
collected what I desire.

00:29:09.430 --> 00:29:11.430
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:29:11.680 --> 00:29:14.640
Here comes the wanted
criminal, Kagato.

00:29:15.060 --> 00:29:19.320
He's such a terrible and
nasty fellow.

00:29:19.320 --> 00:29:22.650
He says Tenchi is the key to the
secret of the universe.

00:29:22.650 --> 00:29:24.530
And starts fighting
against Tenchi.

00:29:24.530 --> 00:29:26.490
He also kidnaps Ryoko.

00:29:26.490 --> 00:29:27.820
What's he up to?

00:29:27.820 --> 00:29:31.620
Tenchi, now is
the time to stand up!

00:29:31.740 --> 00:29:35.870
Tenchi Muyo Episode #5
KAGATO ATTACKS!

00:29:35.870 --> 00:29:36.460
Could Tenchi finally
be our hero?

00:29:36.460 --> 00:29:39.130
KAGATO ATTACKS!
